&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamtheooga&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3942052&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609057198&quot; alt=&quot;IAmTheOoga&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3942052)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamtheooga&quot;  &gt;IAmTheOoga&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Universal Antidote and Detoxification. UAD kits have proven to be 48% effective at removing symptoms of SCP-5266 if administered within 6 minutes of the event&#039;s onset.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Ex. &amp;quot;IDIOT SUCCUMBS TO NEUROTOXIN WHILE LISTENING TO MACHO MAN CLICK NOW TO SEE&amp;quot; in case 5266-51 or &amp;quot;DISCO GONE WRONG?!?!! OFFICE WORKER GETS POISONED&amp;quot; in case 5266-07&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Foundation cryptography teams have been assigned to decoding the signals, with success pending.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Substance may change depending on current target and their level of resistance, as indicated by the events of 08/11/2016.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Separate incident log is restricted to Level 3 personnel or higher.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-943522-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Referred to as Entity M-A6 for the remainder of this documentation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
