&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:277px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-4606/D.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:277px;&quot; alt=&quot;D.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:277px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-4606, circa 1918. Picture received courtesy of O5-3.&lt;/p&gt;
