&lt;p&gt;On 04/28/2014, an earthquake, with 28 aftershocks in the span of three hours, was reported in the Alamogordo area, opening up 12 sinkholes in the area. Temperatures spontaneously increased by an average of 3 degrees Celsius for approximately 30 minutes. Following these events, SCP-4605-1 ceased all communication for two weeks. after sending an additional attachment, one image, which is attached below, along with the PDF sent in the previous log.&lt;/p&gt;
