&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-4605-1 has continued to display decreasing levels of electrical and neurological intensity. It is theorized individual instances of SCP-4605 are detaching from SCP-4605-1&#039;s main mass. Research into what is beneath SCP-4605-1 is currently ongoing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
