rc="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7131235&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609057200" alt="DrPepperThePeeper" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7131235)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drpepperthepeeper" >DrPepperThePeeper</a></span></p> 
