&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-277012-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. For some pictures of said girls, please see the &amp;quot;Cool Stuff!&amp;quot; part of the page.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-277012-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. For an explanation as to what this is, see the &amp;quot;Cool Stuff!&amp;quot; part of the page.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-277012-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. And will most likely by the dumbest I ever will.&lt;/div&gt;
