&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-277012-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Yes, you’ve heard me right - summing.&lt;/div&gt;
